 for Forrest County runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 47% of normal in September to October. So far in 2026 it got 281% in May to June. On grid 13363 the preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 44.1, and RMA&rsquo;s final index can differ.</p>"}
